1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
炒不够时间，会"见小人"
Undercook it — you'll "see little people"

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
这菌叫见手青
This one's jianshouqing

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
一切开就变靛蓝
Slice it — it turns indigo

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
"见手就青"，名字由来
Touch it, it greens — hence the name

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
没炒熟，含毒素
Undercooked, it's toxic

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
中毒会头晕、呕吐
Dizziness, vomiting

7
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,000
还会看见幻觉
And hallucinations

8
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
有人说，满地小人
Some say tiny people everywhere

9
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,000
规矩：炒够20分钟
The rule: fry a full 20 minutes

10
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,000
趁热吃，别碰凉菌
Eat it hot — never cold

11
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,000
医生没炒透，昏迷两天
A doctor undercooked it — 2-day coma

12
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
守住规矩，再吃贵的
Keep the rule, earn the pricey ones

13
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,000
下集：一斤上千的松茸
Next: ¥1000-a-pound matsutake
